          "unlock": "Constellation Lv. 3",
          "description": "Increases the Level of Elemental Skill Eternal Tides by 3. Maximum upgrade level is 15. All nearby party members' Lunar Reaction DMG is elevated Elevation Special DMG Boost effect. It is calculated independently of other DMG Boost effects. by 1.5%.",
          "level": 3,
