          "description": "When Ifa is in the Nightsoul's Blessing state, every 1 Nightsoul point out of the total in his entire party will grant him 1 Rescue Essentials Rescue Essentials Max 150 points. Each Rescue Essentials point Ifa has will increase the Swirl and Electro-Charged DMG dealt by nearby party members by 1.5%, and their Lunar-Charged DMG dealt by 0.2%. These points will be cleared when his Nightsoul's Blessing state ends. point. Rescue Essentials will increase the Swirl, Electro-Charged, and Lunar-Charged DMG dealt by all nearby party members.",
